WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Browse five PreStocks baskets. Predict and Cover use test money on Solana devnet; Hold opens a desk draft.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Choose a basket and adjust the holdings and cash sleeve. Drafting needs no wallet.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Set limits. The app labels which checks are enforced by the future program and which by the desk's own code.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
The optional test read needs a wallet message signature, uses paper cash and sends no transaction.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Creating the practice desk also needs a wallet message signature. This tour stops before any signature.
